<title>USA: TABLE - INMC Mortgage Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - INMC Mortgage Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, Calif. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					   June 30,	June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Net revenues     29,659	21,215     58,398     41,056</p>
<p>Net interest income</p>
<p>			   27,950	19,302     55,019     37,794</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses</p>
<p>			    3,900	 2,646	7,800	5,049</p>
<p>Unrealized gains on securities</p>
<p> NET EARNINGS	  22,656	16,369     44,001     31,727</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE    0.43	  0.37	 0.85	 0.72</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding   53,296,345  44,649,927 51,674,810 43,877,750</p>
<p>(Dollar amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  INMC Mortgage Holdings Inc said it completed the acquisition of its manager, Countrywide Asset Management Corp, from Countrywide Credit Industries Inc in July 1997. In that transaction, Countrywide Crecdit received 3,440,860 newly issued common shares of INMC.</p>
